{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263640/extras/2989a48a014bc38ce168bfac053494a4.avif?t=1760496076\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a goddess capable of travelling through time, you wake up not to the smell of your morning coffee - but to the stench of catastrophe, and the chilling realization that the horns signifying the world's doom have been sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masquerading as a tactician hailing from a distant land, you must command armies in the face of this yet unknown threat. Secure your comrades' trust, gather the crucial Insight required to realize a better tomorrow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turning Hindsight into Foresight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263640/extras/fb13a6aa9c0fe26166a744b89d3c1372.poster.avif?t=1760496076\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263640/extras/fb13a6aa9c0fe26166a744b89d3c1372.webm?t=1760496076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263640/extras/fb13a6aa9c0fe26166a744b89d3c1372.mp4?t=1760496076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strength lies in tactical acumen, not raw power - leave that to the heroes and troops you command. Choose one of four warring factions, and lead their armies to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, defeat appears inevitable. With each passing loop, turn hindsight into foresight. Surprise everyone with strategies born out of your divine powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonds that Persist Through 3000 Timelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This hand sign is known only to me and Eirlys. If you know this too, that means we are now real-real friends now! I hope that no matter when, you remember me as a friend too. Pinky promise?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend your comrades and share memories only shared with their dearest friends. Forge unshakable bonds capable of changing the future, with real-real friends willing to follow even the most blasphemous orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Means to Execute the Plans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263640/extras/d5cc52f8595c1b15a428679147d99f2e.poster.avif?t=1760496076\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263640/extras/d5cc52f8595c1b15a428679147d99f2e.webm?t=1760496076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263640/extras/d5cc52f8595c1b15a428679147d99f2e.mp4?t=1760496076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every invincible armies lies the right infrastructure to let them thrive. Transform your humble Town into a thriving, beautiful bastion capable of providing the logistics necessary for that. Make it the beacon of hope capable of withstanding the doom and gloom surrounding this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Goddess Investigates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the cause behind the cataclysm using the local taverns, or let your vanquished foes cough up the information. What you know today, you know even more by tomorrow. Use the insight you gathered to slow down your enemies temporarily, and eventually... permanently.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263640?t=1760496076