 of magic, and share pleasant memories with your comrades, carrying their trust into the next loop... Always.","steam_appid":3263640,"support_info":{"email":"contact@wizdreamgames.com","url":"https://tgltgame.com"},"supported_languages":"English, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://tgltgame.com"}